Subject: [PATCH] dbgcore: Forward the public MiniDump exports to dbghelp.

Provide the Windows dbgcore module and its public ordinals using Wine's
existing dbghelp implementations, rather than substituting success results.

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -2667,6 +2667,7 @@
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/davclnt)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/dbgeng)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/dbgeng/tests)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/dbgcore)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/dbghelp)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/dbghelp/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/dciman32)
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/dbgcore/Makefile.in
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+MODULE    = dbgcore.dll
+IMPORTLIB = dbgcore
+
+EXTRADLLFLAGS = -Wb,--data-only
+
+SOURCES = \
+	dbgcore.spec
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/dbgcore/dbgcore.spec
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+1 stdcall MiniDumpReadDumpStream(ptr long ptr ptr ptr) dbghelp.MiniDumpReadDumpStream
+2 stdcall MiniDumpWriteDump(ptr long ptr long ptr ptr ptr) dbghelp.MiniDumpWriteDump
